$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add Checking --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add leumi --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 25000 --date 2026-10-01
Added account leumi (ILS).

$ moolah account add chase --kind card --currency USD
Added account chase (USD).

$ moolah account add harel --kind pension --currency ILS --opening 380000 --date 2026-01-01
Added account harel (ILS).

$ moolah add leumi -200 food:groceries --payee Shufersal --date 2026-10-03
Added transaction 3 on 2026-10-03 (Shufersal):
  leumi                          -200.00 ILS
  groceries                      200.00 ILS

$ moolah add chase -42.17 shopping --payee Amazon --date 2026-10-05 --tag vacation-2026
Added transaction 4 on 2026-10-05 (Amazon):
  chase                          -42.17 USD
  shopping                       42.17 USD

$ moolah add leumi -85 restaurnts
error: unknown account "restaurnts". Did you mean restaurants?
[exit 1]

$ moolah add leumi -85 food
